```
# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
pages-dist/
.wrangler/
*.js
# Bundled worker sources the deploy engine falls back to (the upstream repos are
# private, so `/repo/*.js` is the copy that actually deploys). Ignored by the
# `*.js` rule above, which is how `git clean`/a plain `git add` dropped them and
# every CFnew / NEXUS deployment died with "failed to fetch worker source".
!public/repo/*.js

# Generated deploy config (scripts/deploy.sh writes it with the live D1 id)
wrangler.deploy.toml

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Editors
.vscode/

# Environment
.env
.env.local
*.env.*
```